@startuml
title E Visa Processing And Follow Up System - UML State Machine Diagram

state StartChoice <<choice>>
state LoggedOut
state ApplicantChoice <<choice>>
state ApplicationSubmitted
state PaymentMade
state ApplicationAccepted
state StatusViewed
state StatusChecked
state ApplicationCancelled
state DetailsModified
state FeedbackGiven
state LoggedIn
state InitialState
state Completion

[*] --> InitialState : Create Account / Login
InitialState --> StartChoice
StartChoice --> LoggedOut: Login [valid: account_created]
LoggedOut --> ApplicantChoice: Login [valid: logged_out]
ApplicantChoice --> ApplicationSubmitted: Apply for Visa / Check Status / Cancel Application / Modify Details / Give Feedback / Logout [valid: logged_in]
ApplicationSubmitted --> PaymentMade: Make Payment
PaymentMade --> ApplicationAccepted: Accepted
ApplicationAccepted --> StatusViewed: View Status [valid: application_accepted]
StatusViewed --> StatusChecked: Check Status
StatusChecked --> StatusViewed: Back to Status View
StatusViewed --> FeedbackGiven: Give Feedback
FeedbackGiven --> LoggedIn: Done
LoggedOut --> ApplicantChoice: Login [valid: logged_out]
ApplicationCancelled --> ApplicationSubmitted: Cancel Application [valid: application_cancelled]
DetailsModified --> DetailsModified: Modified Details [valid: details_modified]
DetailsModified --> LoggedIn: Modified Details [valid: details_modified]
LoggedIn --> Completion : Logout / Give Feedback / View Details / Complete Status Update
Completion --> [*] : COMPLETION_EVENT
@enduml
